# AHA — Artificial Human Assistant

**Canonical doc:** `AHA_PHILOSOPHY.md` (single source of truth). Read it before branding, UX copy, or architecture changes.

## Language
- Say **assistant**, **helps**, **posts when you ask** — never **automation**, **automate**, or “automating social media.”
- Product: **AHA** @ dailyassist.xyz — daily computer assistance (like Claude computer use / Operator / Copilot).

## Tiers
- **Tier 1:** Local precision on Mac/Windows — social flows (`m9_social`), dev/OS (`m9_local` + `m9_native`), vault/calendar, **no LLM execution**; chat parses intent only.
- **Tier 2:** Other tasks — BYOK in companion settings; easy = text context to AI, hard = screenshot to AI; AI picks buttons, agents click (~10× cheaper than full vision loops).

## Modules (orchestrated by m8)
m1 timing, m2 kinematic, m3 visual, m4 policy, m5 linguistic, m6 bridge, m7 lifecycle, m8 orchestrator, m9_router, m9_local, m9_native, m9_social/generator/parser, m10 scheduler.
